    "roomsPageTitle": "Rooms & studios to rent in the Netherlands | Woonwekker",
    "roomsMeta": "Find rooms and studios to rent in Amsterdam, Utrecht, Rotterdam and across the Netherlands. Compare photos and prices — your next chapter starts with Woonwekker.",
